WEBVTT

01:25.040 --> 01:28.040
ADAPTED FROM THE LEGEND
OF KUNSHAN JADE BY TAN TIANYIN

01:53.880 --> 01:54.840
Mr. Qin,

01:56.400 --> 01:57.640
how's it going?

02:01.120 --> 02:02.200
Come over.

02:04.920 --> 02:07.920
In glassmaking,
cooling is the most crucial part.

02:08.440 --> 02:09.680
Its shape, its form…

02:09.759 --> 02:11.640
All determined in that instant of cooling.

02:12.160 --> 02:13.400
Don't rush it.

02:18.560 --> 02:20.400
Is making glass this difficult?

02:22.320 --> 02:24.440
I only know about jewelry, not glass.

02:26.360 --> 02:27.680
Let's hope it works.

02:29.720 --> 02:30.840
My hands are rusty.

02:31.800 --> 02:33.120
I haven't done this in years.

02:33.760 --> 02:35.080
I've done my best.

02:55.960 --> 02:57.320
No worries, Mr. Qin.

02:57.840 --> 03:00.200
There will always be a next time.

03:00.280 --> 03:01.320
No big deal.

03:05.520 --> 03:08.640
If it fails once, we'll try again.

03:09.280 --> 03:10.960
Yes, Ms. Su is right.

03:11.040 --> 03:12.040
Yeah.

03:14.080 --> 03:16.120
Yingtao, Shiqi,

03:16.200 --> 03:18.840
check if there's anything
that needs fixing.

03:18.920 --> 03:22.640
Ms. Su, could there be
something wrong with the furnace?

03:24.000 --> 03:26.320
Maybe the heat's off?

03:27.440 --> 03:29.320
Mr. Qin is the expert on this.

03:29.400 --> 03:30.720
We don't know much either.

03:30.800 --> 03:33.600
Maybe it's just been too long
for my father.

03:37.320 --> 03:40.240
-Let's try again.
-What should we do?

03:40.320 --> 03:41.640
I mean,

03:43.000 --> 03:44.800
my hands may be rusty,

03:44.880 --> 03:46.960
but the skills are still there.

03:49.480 --> 03:50.800
Look!

03:51.320 --> 03:52.520
It worked!

03:52.600 --> 03:53.920
-It worked!
-It worked!

03:54.000 --> 03:54.960
Let me see!

03:57.320 --> 04:00.240
Mr. Qin, you kept us in suspense!
I thought it was all for nothing.

04:00.320 --> 04:01.920
Ms. Su, look!

04:12.120 --> 04:13.160
It worked.

04:14.400 --> 04:17.399
This is just as good
as the glass I saw in the West.

04:19.120 --> 04:21.560
Mr. Qin, you haven't lost your touch!

04:22.800 --> 04:25.800
Thanks to Miss Su's support.

04:25.880 --> 04:32.080
In all of Yangzhou, no other shop
dares to invest like Clear Mind does

04:33.120 --> 04:35.360
to make its own glass.

04:36.080 --> 04:39.040
Miss Su, thank you.

04:39.640 --> 04:43.800
You've shown me I still have a purpose.

04:43.880 --> 04:48.520
Ms. Su, congratulations.
Your wish has come true.

04:49.640 --> 04:50.800
It came true.

04:56.600 --> 04:57.880
Thank you, Mr. Qin.

04:59.600 --> 05:01.160
Everyone at Clear Mind,

05:02.520 --> 05:03.680
our wish has come true.

05:05.000 --> 05:06.320
From today onward,

05:09.360 --> 05:11.480
Clear Mind has its own glass.

05:11.560 --> 05:12.680
Yes, indeed!

05:14.840 --> 05:18.600
On a joyous day like this,
why the teary eyes?

05:18.680 --> 05:21.080
We should celebrate
and have a proper meal!

05:21.160 --> 05:24.960
-Ms. Su, you're treating us, right?
-Yes, Ms. Su. I want a feast!

05:25.040 --> 05:26.640
-Let's go!
-Whatever you want today.

05:26.720 --> 05:28.760
-Alright, on Ms. Su's tab!
-Mr. Qin, take a rest.

05:28.840 --> 05:30.160
-Sure.
-Let's go!

05:30.240 --> 05:31.280
Let's go, Yunxiu!

05:31.360 --> 05:32.240
Be careful.

05:32.760 --> 05:33.880
-Let's go.
-Thank you, Mr. Qin.

05:33.960 --> 05:35.080
-Let's go.
-Go.

05:35.160 --> 05:36.000
Watch your step.

05:36.920 --> 05:39.880
-Ms. Su, hurry up!
-Take it slow.

05:48.880 --> 05:53.720
In the future, if you experience
temporary blindness or numbness,

05:54.240 --> 05:55.880
it means the illness is progressing.

05:55.960 --> 05:59.320
Eventually, it will lead
to permanent blindness,

06:00.960 --> 06:02.080
then death.

06:08.800 --> 06:09.800
Master Yan.

06:11.280 --> 06:12.360
Are you okay?

06:13.360 --> 06:16.080
-I'm fine. Let's go.
-Let's go.

06:41.480 --> 06:44.360
A dignified inspector like you
coming to Clear Mind,

06:44.440 --> 06:45.960
it can't just be to watch
a kiln opening, right?

06:46.040 --> 06:47.880
I came because I have
something to ask you.

06:49.640 --> 06:51.760
Someone's here to take Xu Nanying away.

06:51.840 --> 06:53.320
Official Wang
from the Court of Judicial Review.

07:00.880 --> 07:02.040
You knew about this, right?

07:02.640 --> 07:04.520
Official Wang is just a pawn.

07:04.600 --> 07:06.400
He wants to take Xu Nanying,

07:06.480 --> 07:08.480
but we'll make sure he can't.
Simple as that.

07:08.560 --> 07:10.840
Yan Zijing,
I knew it was you who poisoned him.

07:12.120 --> 07:13.800
A minor thing. No need to thank me.

07:14.840 --> 07:17.760
You actually expect me to thank you?
What you did was illegal.

07:19.720 --> 07:22.280
Once Official Wang leaves,
another Official Li will come,

07:22.360 --> 07:24.920
then an Official Zhang after that,
then another Official Li.

07:25.440 --> 07:27.360
Eventually, someone will come
who won't let you keep your head up.

07:27.440 --> 07:29.440
-What will you do then?
-But you can't just poison people.

07:29.520 --> 07:31.320
Can't you stop being so rigid?

07:34.400 --> 07:35.240
Yan Zijing,

07:35.320 --> 07:37.840
you keep breaking the law,
again and again.

07:37.920 --> 07:38.760
Have you ever thought

07:38.840 --> 07:40.520
about what would happen
if you're exposed one day?

07:40.600 --> 07:42.080
You're so by-the-book,

07:42.160 --> 07:44.600
but if criminals go free because of it,
what then?

07:47.800 --> 07:51.640
Anyway, at least for Duanwu's sake,
rein in your tactics.

07:57.000 --> 07:58.600
-Are you listening?
-Got it.

08:06.520 --> 08:09.400
The Black Dragon Bandits
killed Shrimp, Mr. Cao.

08:10.280 --> 08:13.000
-Did you tell her about it?
-I've told her everything.

08:13.880 --> 08:16.920
But with Duanwu's nature,
she'll definitely seek revenge.

08:18.280 --> 08:20.480
-You'll protect her, right?
-Of course, I will.

08:23.600 --> 08:24.680
As a friend, of course.

08:26.680 --> 08:28.040
You don't sound sincere.

08:28.120 --> 08:32.960
I never got the chance before,
and maybe I won't in the future.

08:34.799 --> 08:37.880
But as for you,
the misunderstanding is cleared up now.

08:38.799 --> 08:40.600
So, why are you still hesitating here?

08:47.280 --> 08:49.480
-It's too late.
-Listen, Yan Zijing,

08:49.560 --> 08:52.920
as long as you're alive,
there's still a chance.

08:53.000 --> 08:54.520
What's all this "too late" nonsense?

08:58.040 --> 09:00.040
Aren't you alive, too?
Isn't it too late for you, too?

09:02.560 --> 09:04.080
I just can't talk sense with you.

09:06.080 --> 09:08.600
Less talk, more work.
Look, the water's boiling. Add some now.

09:18.400 --> 09:20.880
Here I am, an inspector,
cooking at your place.

09:21.400 --> 09:23.640
If you're happy with it, so be it.

09:30.720 --> 09:33.480
Recently, fewer traders
from the West are bringing beryl.

09:33.560 --> 09:36.280
Beryl stones are getting scarce.
Prices are slightly up.

09:37.160 --> 09:38.320
Speed up

09:39.120 --> 09:42.360
and ride this price wave
to finish and sell the beryl stones.

09:42.880 --> 09:43.960
That way, we're on the safe side.

09:48.880 --> 09:50.920
But we can't just rely
on selling beryl stones.

09:51.000 --> 09:53.200
Zhenlang Pavilion
is practically empty now.

09:53.280 --> 09:54.880
We're down to selling
worthless items to make up the numbers,

09:54.960 --> 09:56.800
like flower hairpins and rouge.

09:56.880 --> 09:59.520
-It's not a sustainable plan.
-Don't worry.

10:00.080 --> 10:02.160
Once everything is ready on your end,

10:02.240 --> 10:04.760
I'll go home and swallow my pride
to ask my dad.

10:05.280 --> 10:06.520
To keep things under wraps,

10:07.040 --> 10:09.920
he'll definitely hand over some
other jewelry for Zhenlang Pavilion.

10:10.440 --> 10:12.040
-Master Wu.
-Come in.

10:14.440 --> 10:15.280
Master Wu,

10:15.360 --> 10:18.400
Kang Ming, the wealthy merchant from Kang,
arrives in Yangzhou tomorrow

10:18.480 --> 10:20.640
to procure jewelry for the royal family.

10:21.840 --> 10:23.360
-Is this reliable information?
-Yes, absolutely.

10:23.440 --> 10:24.680
The other guild directors
have heard the news.

10:29.760 --> 10:32.000
You want to sell this batch
to the State of Kang?

10:33.600 --> 10:35.240
Isn't this a perfect opportunity?

10:37.600 --> 10:40.160
But all we have is beryl stones.
They come from the Western Regions,

10:40.240 --> 10:41.640
so why would the State of Kang buy them?

10:41.720 --> 10:43.760
We could bundle them
with other jewelry as accessories.

10:44.680 --> 10:46.320
We can't miss this chance.

10:47.720 --> 10:50.400
Tomorrow, you'll come with me.

11:00.000 --> 11:00.960
Yunxiu,

11:02.120 --> 11:04.200
what are you holding? A new piece?

11:04.280 --> 11:05.120
Yes.

11:05.880 --> 11:06.880
Let me see it.

11:08.560 --> 11:11.520
Yunxiu, let me have a look!

11:12.080 --> 11:13.680
This is a glass sample.

11:14.200 --> 11:15.920
Ms. Su is taking it
for business negotiations tomorrow.

11:16.000 --> 11:18.480
Yunxiu, just one quick look!

11:18.560 --> 11:21.080
Or at least tell me about it.
I swear I won't touch it.

11:21.160 --> 11:22.480
You absolutely won't?

11:29.840 --> 11:33.240
Look, Ms. Su modified
these designs over and over,

11:33.320 --> 11:35.000
and these colors…

11:35.080 --> 11:36.320
Aren't they unique?

11:36.840 --> 11:39.600
Mr. Qin and I worked for days and nights
to perfect it.

11:39.680 --> 11:42.520
There's a whole pile of flawed glass
stacked up in the workshop.

11:43.200 --> 11:46.760
This glass is so rare, so beautiful.

11:46.840 --> 11:49.560
If those ladies see it,
they'll definitely rush to buy it.

11:49.640 --> 11:51.160
They're sure to love it.

11:52.400 --> 11:53.640
I love it too.

11:56.160 --> 11:58.520
There's only this one set,
so if it breaks, that's it.

11:59.040 --> 12:01.520
Yunxiu, I won't break it.

12:01.600 --> 12:03.160
You just promised you wouldn't touch it.

12:03.240 --> 12:04.440
Acting cute won't work now.

12:05.800 --> 12:08.000
But there's a new set of jewelry
in the workshop,

12:08.080 --> 12:09.560
and no one's tried it on yet.

12:09.640 --> 12:12.200
How about giving that one a try?

12:14.720 --> 12:16.040
-Let's go, then.
-Let's go!

12:16.120 --> 12:18.600
-Not angry anymore?
-Not even a little.

12:20.440 --> 12:23.560
It's really beautiful, Yunxiu.
How did you make it?

12:25.040 --> 12:27.000
Please, just let us in.

12:27.080 --> 12:28.440
Just one look at Mr. Kang.

12:28.520 --> 12:30.520
Everyone should get a fair chance!

12:30.600 --> 12:31.640
Exactly!

12:31.720 --> 12:33.320
Mr. Kang rarely comes
all the way from the West.

12:33.400 --> 12:35.240
Just let us in to see him.

12:35.320 --> 12:36.680
Just let us in!

12:36.760 --> 12:38.320
How many times do I have to tell you?

12:38.400 --> 12:40.240
Only guild directors are allowed inside.

12:40.320 --> 12:41.440
Who do you think you are?

12:41.520 --> 12:43.680
Mr. Kang is here in Yangzhou
to buy jewelry,

12:43.760 --> 12:45.120
and everyone has a chance to compete.

12:45.200 --> 12:46.560
Why can't we go in?

12:46.640 --> 12:47.920
-Yeah!
-Why can't we?

12:48.000 --> 12:49.360
Why can't we go in?

12:50.600 --> 12:52.360
-Move aside!
-Step aside!

12:54.880 --> 12:56.120
Master Wu, please.

13:11.200 --> 13:14.040
Mr. Kang is a prominent merchant
from the West,

13:14.120 --> 13:15.760
treated with high regard
in the State of Kang.

13:16.400 --> 13:19.960
Ordinary merchants
wouldn't even catch his eye.

13:20.040 --> 13:24.360
If anyone brings in poor-quality jewelry,

13:24.440 --> 13:27.520
it would disgrace
the Yangzhou Jewelry Guild.

13:27.600 --> 13:28.560
Keep an eye on them.

13:29.080 --> 13:33.560
-Don't let riffraff disturb Mr. Kang.
-Yes, Master Wu.

13:36.360 --> 13:38.880
YANGZHOU JEWELRY GUILD

13:38.960 --> 13:40.720
Ms. Su, what should we do?

13:43.080 --> 13:44.200
Just wait.

13:45.600 --> 13:46.800
He'll have to come out eventually.

13:59.520 --> 14:02.960
I came to Yangzhou
hoping to buy genuine treasures.

14:03.040 --> 14:04.600
Don't waste my time

14:06.920 --> 14:08.480
with these cheap items.

14:08.560 --> 14:10.000
I have finer pieces.

14:10.080 --> 14:12.400
-Perhaps you'd like to take a look?
-Yes.

14:13.520 --> 14:15.080
Greetings, Mr. Kang.

14:18.200 --> 14:22.520
Mr. Kang, my father is Zheng Shiyuan,
head of Yangzhou Jewelry Guild.

14:22.600 --> 14:24.000
I am Zheng Wu from the Zheng family.

14:24.080 --> 14:28.160
May I know what type of jewelry you wish
to purchase on this visit to Yangzhou?

14:30.200 --> 14:31.760
You can ask around.

14:31.840 --> 14:34.720
In all of Yangzhou,
Zheng's Jubao House leads the way.

14:34.800 --> 14:37.560
We can find any jewelry you want.

14:38.280 --> 14:40.680
-So you're Zheng Wu from the Zheng family?
-That's correct.

14:42.320 --> 14:45.400
Even in the Western Regions,
I've heard of Zheng's Jubao House.

14:46.000 --> 14:47.440
Let me be frank with you.

14:47.520 --> 14:50.040
I'm here to buy a batch
of top-quality beryl stones.

14:58.880 --> 15:01.280
Pardon my curiosity,

15:02.200 --> 15:03.760
but you're from the West.

15:03.840 --> 15:07.520
Why come all the way to Yangzhou
to buy beryl stones?

15:08.320 --> 15:09.880
The West is unstable now.

15:09.960 --> 15:12.000
Even if there are beryl stones,
they can't be transported out.

15:12.600 --> 15:14.320
It'd take a lot of manpower.

15:14.960 --> 15:17.960
I came to Yangzhou just to try my luck.

15:20.080 --> 15:22.520
Mr. Kang, you've come
at just the right time.

15:22.600 --> 15:26.360
In Zheng's Jubao House,
we have everything you need.

15:33.480 --> 15:34.680
This is Mr. Kang from the Western Regions!

15:34.760 --> 15:35.680
Mr. Kang!

15:39.360 --> 15:41.080
-Move aside!
-Mr. Kang!

15:41.160 --> 15:42.960
Mr. Kang, since it's an honor
to have you here,

15:43.040 --> 15:44.920
why not stop by our shop, Clear Mind?

15:45.000 --> 15:48.240
A female merchant
in the Yangzhou Jewelry Guild?

15:48.320 --> 15:50.560
The Yangzhou Jewelry Guild
is an open-minded place.

15:50.640 --> 15:52.200
Though I am just a woman,

15:52.280 --> 15:54.160
I've earned a place here.

15:58.880 --> 16:01.040
Clear Mind may be a small shop,

16:01.120 --> 16:03.040
but we do have some fine jewelry.

16:03.120 --> 16:04.440
I invite Mr. Kang to take a look.

16:04.520 --> 16:08.680
Indeed, this Clear Mind
has glassware in all kinds of designs.

16:08.760 --> 16:12.120
It's quite popular
among common women in Yangzhou.

16:12.840 --> 16:15.000
I often travel between
the Tang Empire and Persia,

16:15.080 --> 16:17.600
and I'm quite fond of glass myself.

16:18.120 --> 16:20.800
However, my purpose this time
is beryl stones.

16:21.320 --> 16:23.280
Beryl stones as blue as the sky.

16:24.480 --> 16:26.840
-Beryl stones?
-Ms. Su, do you even know

16:27.360 --> 16:29.040
how much a beryl stone is worth?

16:33.280 --> 16:36.760
For top-quality beryl,
one stone is worth a fine horse.

16:38.280 --> 16:40.280
This isn't the kind of business

16:40.360 --> 16:41.520
a small place like Clear Mind
can meddle in.

16:42.400 --> 16:46.080
So, please, Ms. Su,
don't waste Mr. Kang's time.

16:46.600 --> 16:47.600
While I may not have beryl stones,

16:49.000 --> 16:52.160
Mr. Kang, I do have glass
as clear as spring water.

16:52.240 --> 16:55.240
Crafted with Tang techniques,
the only one of its kind in Yangzhou.

16:57.720 --> 16:58.760
Tang craftsmanship?

17:04.160 --> 17:05.200
Hold on.

17:06.319 --> 17:07.760
If there's anything lacking,

17:08.720 --> 17:10.680
I'd be honored
if you could offer guidance.

17:11.520 --> 17:15.119
Nowadays, only glass from Persia
and the Arabian regions is valuable.

17:15.760 --> 17:17.880
Some even consider them gifts from heaven.

17:18.480 --> 17:19.440
Do you know why?

17:20.040 --> 17:22.920
They're crystal-clear,
surpassing even quartz.

17:23.000 --> 17:25.680
Yes. But as for your glass items,

17:25.760 --> 17:27.079
the color is impure,
and the quality is lacking.

17:27.160 --> 17:29.720
You rely solely on design for appeal.

17:29.800 --> 17:32.600
In the marketplaces,
they might make a small splash,

17:32.680 --> 17:34.800
but they'd never
catch the eye of nobility.

17:34.880 --> 17:37.960
Such poor goods
would only taint Mr. Kang's sight.

17:38.560 --> 17:42.400
Mr. Kang, in Jubao House,
we have both top-quality beryl stones

17:42.480 --> 17:44.320
and glass as clear as crystal.

17:45.280 --> 17:47.400
Please, do visit Jubao House.

17:47.480 --> 17:50.520
Another day, perhaps.
I'm a bit tired today.

17:51.880 --> 17:53.080
Mr. Kang!

17:56.920 --> 17:58.520
Su Muzhe,

18:00.120 --> 18:02.840
you went through all this effort
just to embarrass yourself.

18:02.920 --> 18:04.200
Was it worth it?

18:05.440 --> 18:07.360
Embarrass myself?

18:07.880 --> 18:10.880
Just getting Mr. Kang's feedback
is a reward in itself.

18:13.760 --> 18:19.920
I'm curious to see how long you can last
on Mr. Qin's glass alone.

18:32.320 --> 18:33.200
Let's go.

18:40.920 --> 18:42.320
How's Xu Nanying's situation?

18:42.400 --> 18:44.120
Thanks to you, Master Yan,

18:44.200 --> 18:46.320
Official Wang is stuck there,
frustrated every day.

18:48.320 --> 18:49.480
How are things on your end?

18:51.840 --> 18:54.560
This deal could lead to a long-term trade
with the State of Kang.

18:55.560 --> 18:57.360
The Zheng family
surely wouldn't let that pass,

18:57.440 --> 18:59.280
but of course, they'll proceed cautiously.

19:00.320 --> 19:03.640
Ever since Kang Ming spread the word
about wanting to buy beryl stones,

19:04.160 --> 19:05.520
all of Yangzhou has gone crazy.

19:05.600 --> 19:08.760
The price of beryl stones
shot up as a result.

19:09.280 --> 19:12.480
The problem is,
now we can't find any beryl stones.

19:12.560 --> 19:14.160
From what you're saying,

19:14.680 --> 19:16.080
are you planning
to enter the beryl business?

19:17.680 --> 19:20.320
-What's wrong with it?
-Just focus on your glass.

19:20.400 --> 19:22.760
That'll stretch you thin
if you try to juggle both.

19:22.840 --> 19:24.720
You know I'm stretched thin,

19:25.560 --> 19:26.800
yet you're being so wasteful?

19:28.440 --> 19:30.320
Haven't I put in my share of effort, too?

19:31.280 --> 19:32.320
And you…

19:36.440 --> 19:39.480
I feel like beryl stones aren't essential.

19:40.400 --> 19:43.760
Look at how high the prices are now.
It's definitely not just for Kang Ming.

19:43.840 --> 19:47.240
I'm afraid someone's already
started buying them up in secret.

19:47.840 --> 19:49.200
We need to be careful.

19:50.000 --> 19:51.760
But who's buying them up,

19:52.480 --> 19:53.440
we don't know.

19:54.800 --> 19:56.920
Master Yan, who do you think it is?

19:57.000 --> 19:58.280
Who's buying them up?

20:01.440 --> 20:02.720
No need to be like that.

20:02.800 --> 20:04.200
I'm the one buying them.

20:06.320 --> 20:08.200
And I used real money to pay.

20:08.280 --> 20:09.800
All spent at high prices.

20:11.200 --> 20:12.320
Wait. What are you doing?

20:14.360 --> 20:15.560
I'm just trying to tell you,

20:15.640 --> 20:17.880
Zheng's jewelry house dominates Yangzhou.

20:17.960 --> 20:20.480
No other merchant dares compete with him.

20:21.040 --> 20:26.080
So, with this order from Kang Ming,
the Zheng family will keep stalling.

20:26.680 --> 20:31.200
But if Clear Mind joins the competition,
the Zheng family will feel the pressure.

20:31.800 --> 20:34.520
But I think
you should focus on making glass.

20:34.600 --> 20:35.640
Don't get distracted.

20:36.840 --> 20:38.040
I can manage both.

20:39.120 --> 20:41.680
Kang Ming is a famous merchant
from the West.

20:41.760 --> 20:45.320
Silk, spices, jewelry…
Any profitable trade, he's involved in it.

20:45.400 --> 20:48.480
This time, he's indeed here
to buy for the Kang royal family.

20:49.360 --> 20:50.520
The State of Kang…

20:51.160 --> 20:52.080
What's wrong with the State of Kang?

20:54.000 --> 20:55.680
Yan Zijing once said he's from there.

20:57.040 --> 20:57.880
Did you confirm it?

20:58.480 --> 20:59.680
I did.

20:59.760 --> 21:03.600
Kang Ming is practically
the wealthiest man in Kang.

21:03.680 --> 21:05.960
Most items used by the Kang royal family
come from him.

21:06.040 --> 21:08.080
Could it just be a coincidence?

21:08.160 --> 21:09.360
I don't think so.

21:10.120 --> 21:11.880
Back in Guangdong,

21:11.960 --> 21:16.000
Yan Zijing plotted things, hoarding pearls
and bringing down the Cui family.

21:17.440 --> 21:19.400
I'm afraid he's trying the same trick
on the Zheng family now.

21:20.240 --> 21:22.360
If this is indeed Yan Zijing's scheme,

21:22.440 --> 21:25.480
the rise in beryl prices
actually benefits us.

21:26.080 --> 21:29.640
Don't forget, that batch of goods
included a lot of beryl stones.

21:30.160 --> 21:32.560
After you dismantled, modified,
and sold them, then…

21:33.640 --> 21:36.320
Yan Zijing would be shooting
himself in the foot.

21:37.120 --> 21:41.280
But I estimate that batch of beryl stones
won't be enough to satisfy Kang Ming.

21:41.360 --> 21:42.760
Then we have no choice.

21:43.320 --> 21:44.800
We'll take it one step at a time.

21:45.920 --> 21:47.960
For now, moving the stock is the priority.

21:51.320 --> 21:52.320
A servant.

21:54.400 --> 21:55.600
Come in.

21:56.680 --> 21:58.280
Master Wu, the master
requests your presence.

22:02.240 --> 22:04.440
Our Clear Mind glass is high-quality
and affordable,

22:04.520 --> 22:07.080
spreading by word of mouth
throughout Yangzhou.

22:07.160 --> 22:10.160
We've truly opened up the market
for women's accessories.

22:10.240 --> 22:13.240
But sales have been slightly dropping
these past few days.

22:13.320 --> 22:14.760
Ms. Su, take a look.

22:15.520 --> 22:17.360
Ms. Su. Over the last few days,

22:17.440 --> 22:20.480
those who've come to Clear Mind
to buy glassware…

22:20.560 --> 22:22.040
Pure and flawless…

22:23.800 --> 22:25.360
What about making glassware?

22:25.440 --> 22:28.760
Mr. Qin's glassware,
combined with Clear Mind's designs,

22:28.840 --> 22:30.040
could sell very well.

22:30.120 --> 22:33.160
Persian glassware is the best.

22:33.240 --> 22:35.320
Even if Clear Mind makes some,

22:35.840 --> 22:38.200
it will be far inferior.

22:38.280 --> 22:41.800
Besides, the Zheng family
specializes in Persian glassware.

22:41.880 --> 22:43.040
Why compete?

22:43.120 --> 22:45.080
Could we experiment with colors?

22:45.160 --> 22:49.320
Even in Zizhou, creating rainbow glass

22:49.400 --> 22:52.040
could take years, even decades, to master,

22:52.120 --> 22:54.840
and the output can't be guaranteed.

22:54.920 --> 22:57.080
So, which path should we take?

23:01.400 --> 23:03.480
Are you insane?
Why do you keep sneaking around?

23:03.560 --> 23:05.800
I walked in openly.

23:05.880 --> 23:07.320
What are you spying on here?

23:07.400 --> 23:08.920
Spying?

23:21.520 --> 23:24.360
What's wrong with you?
Not feeling well again?

23:25.480 --> 23:26.400
It's nothing.

23:28.200 --> 23:31.760
Lately, I've suddenly
been unable to see things clearly.

23:36.320 --> 23:37.600
Wasn't that expected?

23:48.880 --> 23:49.840
Mother,

23:52.680 --> 23:54.760
I pleaded with him for days

23:54.840 --> 23:56.800
before your father agreed to see you.

23:57.440 --> 23:59.400
Don't mess it up again.

24:00.040 --> 24:01.280
Got it.

24:01.360 --> 24:04.200
Your father's scolding
is for your own good.

24:04.280 --> 24:08.080
-What kind of person is Xu Nanying?
-Alright, I understand.

24:08.160 --> 24:09.640
I'm going to see Father.

24:19.520 --> 24:21.080
Father, you wanted to see me?

24:21.160 --> 24:22.120
Sit down.

24:28.360 --> 24:30.800
Regarding that wealthy merchant
from the West, Kang Ming,

24:30.880 --> 24:33.080
how did you find him
after today's interaction?

24:33.160 --> 24:36.360
He has sharp insight
and knows the ways of trade.

24:36.440 --> 24:38.520
He specifically asked for beryl stones.

24:38.600 --> 24:40.640
-He only wants beryl stones?
-Yes.

24:40.720 --> 24:43.280
Father, during the recent Lady Huan case,

24:43.360 --> 24:45.520
Zhang Jinran publicly accused Zheng Si

24:45.600 --> 24:47.760
of fencing goods
for the Black Dragon Bandits.

24:48.760 --> 24:53.040
Given Kang Ming's true intentions,
shouldn't we be cautious?

24:54.400 --> 24:57.040
Keeping that batch of goods here
is nothing but trouble.

24:57.120 --> 25:00.160
Selling it to the West
is the safest option.

25:00.840 --> 25:04.800
Right now, Zhang Jinran is focused
on Xu Nanying's case.

25:04.880 --> 25:07.200
Let's take this chance to clear it out.

25:07.280 --> 25:10.040
Also, our family's
Western trade route is cut off.

25:10.120 --> 25:12.160
If Kang Ming is trustworthy,

25:12.240 --> 25:15.960
you should seize this opportunity
to build a relationship with him

25:16.040 --> 25:17.840
and secure a future for our family.

25:17.920 --> 25:22.360
In that case, I'll go back
and urge Shijiu to expedite the redesigns

25:22.440 --> 25:24.720
to ensure everything goes smoothly.

25:24.800 --> 25:27.800
Send out invitations,
and call everyone together.

25:27.880 --> 25:29.640
Tomorrow, I'll represent
the Yangzhou Jewelry Guild

25:29.720 --> 25:31.200
and host a banquet for Kang Ming.

25:33.320 --> 25:35.280
I'll take care of it.

25:46.080 --> 25:47.400
This is the Zheng family's old residence.

25:48.000 --> 25:49.560
Take your things and get out!

25:50.560 --> 25:52.200
Don't bother our Zheng Wu anymore.

25:52.800 --> 25:54.720
Master Wu let me stay here.

25:55.400 --> 25:57.120
If I leave, it'll be on his orders.

25:57.200 --> 25:59.720
How shameless can you be?

25:59.800 --> 26:01.360
Zheng Wu has treated you more than fairly.

26:01.440 --> 26:03.720
He even gave you
the whole Zhenlang Pavilion,

26:03.800 --> 26:05.040
and yet you're still not satisfied.

26:05.120 --> 26:05.960
He's willing.

26:09.080 --> 26:10.480
Gather her things and throw them out!

26:10.560 --> 26:13.400
The Cui family is already in shambles,
and you still won't stop?

26:13.480 --> 26:15.040
Are you here to ruin my son's life too?

26:18.840 --> 26:20.400
What do you have to be so proud of?

26:21.520 --> 26:23.480
You're so young, yet seducing men,

26:23.560 --> 26:25.800
pretending to be the legitimate daughter
of a noble family.

26:25.880 --> 26:27.880
You're just like your crazy mother,

26:27.960 --> 26:30.720
always putting on airs
as if she's the legitimate wife.

26:30.800 --> 26:32.000
She can't even bear a son.

26:32.080 --> 26:33.640
The Cui family line will die out!

26:37.760 --> 26:39.840
Insult me if you want,

26:41.080 --> 26:42.880
but don't insult my mother.

26:43.960 --> 26:46.400
You and your mother
are cut from the same cloth!

26:49.520 --> 26:51.440
How dare you push me!

26:51.520 --> 26:52.800
Madam!

26:54.160 --> 26:55.640
Madam, let me see.

26:55.720 --> 26:56.960
-Blood!
-Blood…

26:57.040 --> 26:58.360
You jinx!

26:59.360 --> 27:01.640
Hurry! Go get Zheng Wu!

27:01.720 --> 27:04.320
-What do we do now?
-Call a doctor!

27:04.400 --> 27:05.920
I'm bleeding!

27:06.000 --> 27:07.600
-Get Zheng Wu right away!
-Yes!

27:07.680 --> 27:10.560
-Hurry and get Zheng Wu!
-Go call Zheng Wu! Now!

27:11.560 --> 27:13.200
You jinx!

27:16.200 --> 27:17.200
Shijiu.

27:18.160 --> 27:19.400
Shijiu.

27:20.320 --> 27:21.600
What's going on?

27:26.600 --> 27:28.160
My mother…

27:28.880 --> 27:30.160
She's always like that.

27:30.960 --> 27:32.960
When she's angry, she acts like a child.

27:35.280 --> 27:36.600
Don't let it bother you.

27:44.000 --> 27:45.920
Having Zhenlang Pavilion is enough for me.

27:47.360 --> 27:49.000
What's a few insults?

27:54.280 --> 27:55.320
It's nothing.

28:16.040 --> 28:19.280
Tomorrow, my father is hosting
a banquet for Kang Ming.

28:19.800 --> 28:22.080
Prepare yourself and accompany me.

28:22.760 --> 28:23.680
Hosting a banquet for Kang Ming?

28:26.000 --> 28:27.120
Shouldn't we be more cautious?

28:27.200 --> 28:30.640
It's wise to be wary,
but we can't miss this chance either.

28:31.520 --> 28:34.760
We'll make a decision after the banquet.

28:39.520 --> 28:40.920
Mr. Kang, it's a long journey here.

28:41.000 --> 28:42.520
I hope it hasn't been too tiring!

28:42.600 --> 28:44.160
I've long heard
of Master Zheng's great reputation.

28:44.240 --> 28:45.600
To meet

28:45.680 --> 28:48.400
with all you guild directors
of Yangzhou today,

28:48.920 --> 28:51.200
I am truly honored.

28:51.280 --> 28:53.960
Is this your first time
in Yangzhou, Mr. Kang?

28:54.040 --> 28:56.760
Come, try this fine Qionghua wine.

28:57.880 --> 28:59.560
-Please.
-Please.

29:05.520 --> 29:08.240
Mr. Kang,
this is Soft-Cooked Eel in Sauce,

29:08.320 --> 29:09.760
and this is Stewed Pork Ball
in Brown Sauce.

29:09.840 --> 29:11.440
Both are famous Yangzhou dishes.

29:11.520 --> 29:12.800
Please have a taste.

29:24.040 --> 29:26.560
Mr. Kang, why do you seem downhearted?

29:27.200 --> 29:30.040
Have I failed to host you properly?

29:30.120 --> 29:31.440
Master Zheng,

29:32.080 --> 29:33.520
I am troubled.

29:34.240 --> 29:35.880
I traveled south
all the way from Chang'an,

29:35.960 --> 29:36.880
through many places,

29:38.200 --> 29:41.600
yet I still couldn't gather
ten hu of top-quality beryl stones.

29:41.680 --> 29:43.960
Ten hu? This…

29:45.960 --> 29:48.320
I have some, but not much.

29:48.400 --> 29:49.840
I can try to gather more.

29:49.920 --> 29:51.400
-I have some, too.
-I have some as well!

29:51.480 --> 29:52.760
-I have some, too!
-We have some, too!

29:52.840 --> 29:56.280
But with such scattered sources,
how many orders would I need to sign?

29:56.840 --> 29:58.120
It's rather troublesome.

29:58.200 --> 30:01.120
My dear Kang, with the combined power
of the Yangzhou Jewelry Guild,

30:01.200 --> 30:03.720
ten hu of beryl stones
is no great challenge.

30:06.520 --> 30:07.600
How about this?

30:07.680 --> 30:11.000
Let Jubao House take the lead
and sign a contract with you.

30:11.080 --> 30:13.960
We'll gather the beryl stones
from each source.

30:14.040 --> 30:16.200
Wouldn't that be much more convenient?

30:16.800 --> 30:18.960
Does that sound acceptable?

30:19.040 --> 30:20.520
Of course, that's fine.

30:20.600 --> 30:25.000
The Yangzhou Jewelry Guild is united.
We're all one family here.

30:25.080 --> 30:28.280
Everyone, do you have any objections?

30:29.240 --> 30:31.360
We will follow your orders!

30:32.120 --> 30:37.400
With this deal, let's all prosper together
in the long run.

30:38.440 --> 30:40.440
Step aside!

30:40.520 --> 30:41.960
As fellow guild merchants,

30:42.480 --> 30:45.400
why does Jubao House get to monopolize
and take all the profits?

30:45.480 --> 30:48.560
-How rude!
-Yingtao, such disrespect.

30:53.120 --> 30:54.200
Greetings, Mr. Kang.

30:58.120 --> 31:00.360
We're all merchants
of the Yangzhou Jewelry Guild.

31:00.440 --> 31:02.240
Each should play to their strengths.

31:02.320 --> 31:05.280
Why should one business dominate
and oppress the others?

31:05.880 --> 31:07.160
Oppress?

31:07.240 --> 31:10.120
As the guild head, 1I'm doing this

31:10.200 --> 31:14.000
to prevent unnecessary losses
from reckless stockpiling

31:14.080 --> 31:16.240
and fierce competition.

31:16.320 --> 31:18.840
Isn't that right, everyone?

31:18.920 --> 31:20.840
Master Zheng is very considerate.

31:21.680 --> 31:22.880
-You speak wisely.
-Indeed.

31:22.960 --> 31:24.080
-Yes, absolutely.
-Yes.

31:24.160 --> 31:27.320
Yangzhou is vast,
with so many merchants here.

31:27.840 --> 31:29.640
Since Mr. Kang wants beryl stones,

31:30.600 --> 31:32.520
he's bound to compare options.

31:33.640 --> 31:37.040
Now, Clear Mind
also seeks a fair chance to compete.

31:39.360 --> 31:40.360
Su Muzhe,

31:40.440 --> 31:43.880
you weren't invited to this banquet,
yet you came uninvited.

31:44.440 --> 31:46.120
You're certainly shameless.

31:46.200 --> 31:47.520
In business,

31:48.920 --> 31:51.040
being shameless is essential.

31:51.120 --> 31:55.080
If I'm not shameless,
how could I do business in Yangzhou?

31:55.160 --> 31:57.240
-Right?
-Ridiculous.

31:57.320 --> 31:59.600
There are dozens
of guild merchants in Yangzhou.

31:59.680 --> 32:01.720
Do you think just anyone can sit here?

32:01.800 --> 32:03.880
Zheng Wu. We're all guild merchants here.

32:03.960 --> 32:05.600
There's no distinction of rank.

32:06.120 --> 32:08.960
Ms. Su, if you wish to join,

32:09.040 --> 32:12.800
simply gather ten hu
of top-quality beryl stones.

32:14.400 --> 32:17.040
You, glass seller,
what business do you have here?

32:17.120 --> 32:19.800
Exactly, do you even have beryl stones?

32:19.880 --> 32:21.720
Clear Mind has beryl stones.

32:27.560 --> 32:28.760
Mr. Kang,

32:29.760 --> 32:31.640
Clear Mind now possesses beryl stones.

32:32.160 --> 32:35.240
I ask you to grant us
a fair chance to compete.

32:38.560 --> 32:41.440
Ms. Su, this isn't the place for you.

32:42.480 --> 32:43.480
Please leave.

32:43.560 --> 32:45.040
Just a minor interruption.

32:45.120 --> 32:47.520
Let it not discourage your spirits,
my dear Kang.

32:47.600 --> 32:49.960
Come, let's empty this cup.

32:50.040 --> 32:51.520
-Cheers!
-Cheers.

32:51.600 --> 32:52.760
Don't embarrass yourself.

32:52.840 --> 32:54.000
Let's drink!

32:54.080 --> 32:55.640
The Qionghua wine is wonderful,

32:56.240 --> 33:01.920
but our guest from Kang might prefer
Persian Sanlejiang Drink.

33:03.480 --> 33:05.040
-Zheng Wu.
-Yes?

33:05.560 --> 33:07.120
How did you manage things?

33:07.200 --> 33:10.040
How are there always intruders
disturbing our guest?

33:10.120 --> 33:11.800
It's my fault, Father.

33:11.880 --> 33:13.360
-I'll take care of it…
-Sanlejiang Drink?

33:13.440 --> 33:16.560
In Chang'an, Sanlejiang Drink
is everywhere.

33:17.320 --> 33:20.040
But sadly,
I haven't seen it since coming south.

33:20.120 --> 33:23.000
-You're from the State of Kang?
-Indeed.

33:24.120 --> 33:27.320
An old friend in a foreign land
lifts the weight of my lonely drink.

33:27.400 --> 33:30.960
Mr. Kang, would you join me for a drink?

33:31.040 --> 33:32.120
Very well.

33:33.320 --> 33:35.520
-Sit by my side!
-Thank you, Mr. Kang.

33:36.040 --> 33:37.360
Let me introduce you.

33:37.960 --> 33:40.680
Ms. Su of Clear Mind here is…

33:42.280 --> 33:43.160
a dear friend of mine.

33:43.240 --> 33:44.440
Sit by my side too!

33:45.040 --> 33:47.640
Master Zheng, I'll trouble you
to make the arrangements.

33:48.200 --> 33:50.280
Meeting a fellow countryman
in a foreign land,

33:50.360 --> 33:51.280
we must catch up.

33:51.360 --> 33:52.480
You're too kind.

33:53.800 --> 33:56.560
Someone, bring seats.

33:57.960 --> 33:59.080
-Here!
-Here!

34:02.520 --> 34:05.800
The men of the State of Kang
are all strong and brave,

34:05.880 --> 34:07.640
capable of wrestling lions and tigers!

34:09.040 --> 34:11.520
And the dancers there
are graceful and beautiful.

34:11.600 --> 34:14.520
Their dance moves
swift like falling snowflakes.

34:14.600 --> 34:16.000
Exactly!

34:16.520 --> 34:17.600
-Here!
-Here!

34:20.440 --> 34:21.400
What a pity,

34:21.480 --> 34:23.320
I've been trading
with nomads since childhood,

34:23.400 --> 34:24.800
and I haven't returned in so long.

34:24.880 --> 34:28.199
I miss most the golden peaches
of our homeland.

34:28.840 --> 34:33.280
They're large as eggs, sweet and juicy,
truly a heavenly fruit.

34:34.440 --> 34:35.639
-Cheers!
-Cheers!

34:36.159 --> 34:40.360
Ms. Su, you're a friend of Master Yan,
so that makes you my friend as well.

34:40.960 --> 34:44.880
Come, let's drink.
I'll give you a fair chance to compete.

34:46.920 --> 34:48.920
-Thank you, Mr. Kang.
-Cheers!

34:57.360 --> 35:01.320
Everyone, I'm here
to select items for the Kang royal family.

35:01.400 --> 35:04.200
Our royal family
values not only the beryl stones,

35:04.280 --> 35:07.320
but also the styles of Tang beryl.

35:07.840 --> 35:10.360
Let's see who can meet our needs.

35:10.440 --> 35:11.720
I'll drink to that!

35:31.480 --> 35:34.360
YANGZHOU JEWELRY GUILD

35:35.920 --> 35:37.400
This banquet tonight…

35:37.480 --> 35:39.080
Disgusting, revolting!

35:40.240 --> 35:43.360
Su Muzhe had a point.
Why should they monopolize everything?

35:44.200 --> 35:46.840
Truly overbearing. This is just bullying.

35:46.920 --> 35:48.080
What can we do?

35:48.160 --> 35:50.320
Hasn't the guild been like this for years?

35:50.400 --> 35:53.800
For people like us,
just getting scraps is lucky.

35:53.880 --> 35:57.000
So, what are we?
Just here to entertain like songstresses?

36:00.000 --> 36:02.120
That Su Muzhe
does have some skills, though.

36:02.200 --> 36:04.320
She actually managed
to team up with Yan Zijing.

36:04.400 --> 36:06.520
With those two in the mix,

36:07.880 --> 36:10.120
things might get interesting.

36:11.360 --> 36:12.320
Let's go.

36:14.720 --> 36:16.160
After seeing today's events,

36:16.680 --> 36:19.560
it's clear that the Yangzhou Jewelry Guild
isn't that solid.

36:20.080 --> 36:23.400
Looks like the other merchants
are starting to have second thoughts too.

36:24.760 --> 36:27.800
The Zheng family's desperate
to fill their losses.

36:27.880 --> 36:29.200
Their actions are quite ugly.

36:33.880 --> 36:34.800
What's on your mind?

36:38.200 --> 36:39.480
I'm thinking…

36:40.760 --> 36:43.520
The Zheng family has held sway
over Yangzhou for too long.

36:44.040 --> 36:46.080
It might be time to stir things up.

36:47.520 --> 36:50.800
Add some fuel to the fire,
and it'll burn even brighter.

36:51.320 --> 36:52.280
No rush.

36:55.720 --> 36:58.840
After tonight's banquet,
they should be less inclined.

36:59.480 --> 37:01.600
Seeing us work so hard to win this deal,

37:02.120 --> 37:03.600
the Zheng family
should feel the pressure too.

37:04.240 --> 37:06.400
What I didn't expect, though,

37:07.560 --> 37:10.080
is that the price Cui Shijiu paid
for Zhenlang Pavilion

37:10.600 --> 37:14.080
was to sell stolen goods
for the Zheng family.

37:16.440 --> 37:17.320
What's wrong?

37:17.840 --> 37:21.200
Are you pitying Cui Shijiu?

37:22.520 --> 37:23.680
Not exactly.

37:25.880 --> 37:29.120
Everyone makes their choices,
their own sacrifices.

37:32.760 --> 37:34.400
You've really grown a lot.

37:35.160 --> 37:37.920
I believe
the Yangzhou Jewelry Guild's future

37:38.000 --> 37:39.200
will have a place for you.

37:42.760 --> 37:43.960
Are you praising me?

37:45.040 --> 37:46.920
Haven't I always praised you?

37:48.520 --> 37:51.480
Fine. I'll take that as a good omen.

37:52.720 --> 37:56.880
Since you've said it,
we'll make sure Mr. Kang's beryl stones

37:58.280 --> 37:59.360
are perfect.

38:00.440 --> 38:03.600
Isn't that order for the Zheng family?
Why are you bothering with it?

38:03.680 --> 38:06.320
In business,
you can't focus on just one order.

38:08.000 --> 38:09.760
Since Mr. Kang is here,

38:10.480 --> 38:14.040
we need to make sure Clear Mind
holds a place in his mind.

38:17.080 --> 38:19.000
You're getting smarter by the day.

38:20.640 --> 38:21.520
Fine.

38:21.600 --> 38:24.480
When I return, I'll have Kang Ju
bring you the beryl stones.

38:31.920 --> 38:32.880
Let's go.

38:34.280 --> 38:35.280
Wait.

38:37.400 --> 38:39.960
Don't you think the scenery here
is quite nice?

38:40.600 --> 38:42.720
And it's rare for us
to have a moment's peace.

38:45.080 --> 38:47.760
It feels like we've never
really taken the time

38:48.480 --> 38:50.240
to appreciate Yangzhou's nights.

39:06.880 --> 39:07.760
Look,

39:08.640 --> 39:11.600
tonight's moon isn't hidden by clouds.

40:02.200 --> 40:03.520
Add some more wood.

40:06.000 --> 40:08.400
Ms. Su, take a break and have some tea.

40:09.280 --> 40:10.720
Here, drink some water.

40:14.640 --> 40:16.400
Mr. Qin, Yunxiu,

40:16.480 --> 40:18.320
-here are the new designs.
-Alright.

40:19.240 --> 40:20.640
-Here.
-Okay.

40:20.720 --> 40:22.480
PALACE OF PEARLS

40:54.440 --> 40:56.560
Mr. Qin, look. This one
can be made with beryl stones…

40:56.640 --> 40:58.360
-Let's try again…
-Alright!

41:03.320 --> 41:08.680
DESIGN DETAILS

41:48.640 --> 41:51.000
The elegance of the Tang Empire

41:51.080 --> 41:55.080
truly brings out a unique charm
in these Western jewels.

41:55.680 --> 41:59.760
Of course, this is all thanks
to Ms. Su's exquisite designs.

42:00.440 --> 42:01.920
Truly remarkable!

42:02.000 --> 42:05.120
Mr. Kang, since it's a fair competition,

42:05.200 --> 42:09.480
perhaps you'd also like to view
the jewelry from Zhenlang Pavilion?

42:09.560 --> 42:10.600
Certainly.

42:27.680 --> 42:28.600
Go!

42:35.640 --> 42:37.200
You actually have beryl stones
of this quality?

42:37.880 --> 42:41.600
Large as an egg, sky-blue in color,
one in a million, a true rarity!

42:42.600 --> 42:44.120
Mr. Kang, you flatter me.
